    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "he's actually acting a little sleepy but he's not really lethargic or anything. i just feel like the ER will be a total waste of time and money if it's just a common viral thing. if i give him some more tylenol to bring the fever down, and maybe some Benadryl just in case its an allergy, do you think that should fix it? i really just want to stay home and let him sleep it off. i'm sure it's nothing serious.",
